{
  "comment": "The status conversion's word list (spec 016 FR-010, R6) and the cases both guesses are tested against: server/status.go embeds it, server/status_test.go and web/scripts/check-statusgroups.mjs check it. A name is matched whole, after lower case, straight apostrophes, hyphens and underscores as spaces, single spaces and no trailing punctuation. Anything not listed is To-do.",
